  «library file: |.subckt JK-flop-B-source J K CLK Q ¬Q\nB2 lastQ 0 V=if(time<=0,IC,state(1,V(Q)))\nB1 Latch 0 V=if(trigger==0,(V(CLK)>=thres)&(state(1,V(CLK))<thres),(V(CLK)<=thres)&(state(1,V(CLK))>thres))\nB3 Q 0 V=if(V(Latch), if(V(J)>=thres & V(K)>=thres,!V(lastQ), if(V(J)>=thres & V(K)<thres,1, if(V(J)<=thres & V(K)>thres,0,V(lastQ)) ) ) ,V(lastQ))\nB4 ¬Q 0 V=!V(Q)\n.ends JK-flop-B-source»
